{
  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "statement": "餐餐有蔬菜，每天不少于300克，深色蔬菜约占一半。",
      "source_urls": [
        "https://wjw.beijing.gov.cn/xwzx_20031/xwfb/202610/t20261021_4913349.html"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "statement": "外卖按需购买，注意份量和荤素搭配，可向商家提出少油少盐诉求。",
      "source_urls": [
        "https://wjw.beijing.gov.cn/xwzx_20031/xwfb/202610/t20261021_4913349.html"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c3",
      "statement": "膳食应包含不同食物类别；蔬菜不替代全部主食及肉蛋豆类食物。",
      "source_urls": [
        "https://wjw.beijing.gov.cn/xwzx_20031/xwfb/202610/t20261021_4913349.html"
      ]
    }
  ],
